# ── brokerage documents — READ THIS ───────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC and its history is permanent. A Public.com
# statement or trade-confirmation export contains your account number.
# Anything you download from the broker goes in private/ and never gets
# committed. Belt and braces: the file patterns are ignored too.
private/
!private/README.txt
statements/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*statement*.pdf
*confirmation*.pdf
